                                                "sense_id": "357ebf6f-2ac8-356e-81a9-07c75550f522",
                                                "text": "Later ages contributed their own epichorial and distinctive manner to these universal delights in the erotic. In China, The Golden Lotus is an amazing sustained achievement."
